    {
      "title": "Что знает реестр подключения",
      "text": "`db.registry` — описания классов арендатора и System: `has()` — есть ли класс, `find()` — описание или `undefined`, `resolve()` — описание или ошибка, `all()` — все классы, `family()` — класс и потомки, `leafType()` — как сравнивается поле в фильтре. `load()` библиотека вызывает сама, когда меняются классы: здесь им заполнен отдельный реестр строками класса `Class` из таблицы `entity`.",
      "code": "await seedShop(db);\nconst own = new Registry();\nown.load(await db.transaction((tx) => tx.unsafe(`select tenant, rev, data from \"${schema}\".entity where class = 'Class'`)) as never);\nreturn {\n  'has Product / Нет': [db.registry.has('Product'), db.registry.has('Нет')],\n  'find Нет': db.registry.find('Нет') ?? 'undefined',\n  'ключ Product (resolve)': db.registry.resolve('Product').key,\n  'семейство Customer': db.registry.family('Customer').map((c) => c.name),\n  'классов всего (all)': db.registry.all().length,\n  'leafType Product.price / title': [db.registry.leafType('Product', ['price']), db.registry.leafType('Product', ['title'])],\n  'свой реестр после load: столько же классов': own.all().length === db.registry.all().length,\n};",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> seedShop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(db);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> own</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Registry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">own.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unsafe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`select tenant, rev, data from \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">schema</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\".entity where class = 'Class'`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> never</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'has Product / Нет'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [db.registry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), db.registry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Нет'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'find Нет'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: db.registry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Нет'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'undefined'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'ключ Product (resolve)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: db.registry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'семейство Customer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: db.registry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">family</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Customer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.name),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'классов всего (all)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: db.registry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'leafType Product.price / title'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [db.registry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">leafType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'price'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]), db.registry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">leafType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'title'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'свой реестр после load: столько же классов'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: own.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.registry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre>",
