    {
      "title": "Свой SQL в сессии пользователя",
      "text": "`db.sql` — одна транзакция с правами сессии: RLS действует, чужого арендатора не видно. Запись через него сбрасывает весь кэш.",
      "code": "({\n        'db.sql': await db.sql`select ${'Ромашка'}::text as tenant_name, current_setting('letopis.reason', true) as reason`,\n        'db.transaction — только свой арендатор': await db.transaction((tx) =>\n          tx.unsafe(`select class, count(*)::int as n from \"${schema}\".entity where class in ('Shop', 'Product') group by class order by class`)),\n      })",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'db.sql'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sql</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`select ${'Ромашка'}::text as tenant_name, current_setting('letopis.reason', true) as reason`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'db.transaction — только свой арендатор'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          tx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unsafe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`select class, count(*)::int as n from \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">schema</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\".entity where class in ('Shop', 'Product') group by class order by class`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      })</span></span></code></pre>",
